# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Anything matched here is NOT shipped into the build context, so it can't be
# COPY'd into images and doesn't have to be walked by the daemon. Two reasons
# we care:
#
# 1. Permission failures. `data/mongodb/` is owned by UID 999 (mongo runtime
#    user) after the volume migration. A non-root `docker compose build`
#    fails with "permission denied" trying to stat that tree. Same for
#    `data/sensehub_images/` (root-owned). Excluding fixes the build for any
#    fresh deployer.
# 2. Speed. Large local-only directories (node_modules, dist, screenshots,
#    backups, brand reference materials) bloat the context and slow every
#    build cycle.

# ─── Runtime data (perm-fragile or huge) ───────────────────────────────────
data/mongodb/
data/sensehub_images/
data/attachments/
data/starter-data/
backups/

# ─── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ─── Secrets / local config ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.*.local
.credentials/

# ─── VCS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ─── Node / Python build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# ─── Editor / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Test artifacts (not for shipping) ─────────────────────────────────────
.playwright-mcp/
playwright-report/
test-results/
test-screenshots/
test-screenshots-detailed/
screenshots/

# ─── Design / brand reference materials (not source code) ──────────────────
Brand_Engineering/
For Investors/
OldData/

# ─── Backup tarballs that may live alongside the repo ──────────────────────
*.tar.gz
*.tar

# ─── Frontend build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────
frontend/user-portal/dist/
frontend/shared/dist/

# ─── Misc ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.iml
.history/
*.bak
